1
00:00:03,500 --> 00:00:11,340
With the application of information technology in education, college students can now learn in more diverse and efficient ways.
随着信息技术在教育中的应用，大学生如今能够以更加多样、更加高效的方式学习。

2
00:00:12,140 --> 00:00:16,110
Gone are the days when learning was limited to textbooks and classrooms.
学习只局限于课本和课堂的日子已经一去不复返了。

3
00:00:16,910 --> 00:00:20,340
Today, a smartphone opens the door to a world of knowledge.
如今，一部智能手机就能打开通往知识世界的大门。

4
00:00:21,140 --> 00:00:23,350
First, learning has become more diverse.
第一，学习变得更加多样了。

5
00:00:24,150 --> 00:00:36,810
Through online courses, students can attend lectures by famous professors from other universities, and through virtual labs, they can conduct experiments that would be too expensive or dangerous in real life.
通过网络课程，学生可以聆听其他大学名教授的讲座；通过虚拟实验室，他们可以开展在现实生活中过于昂贵或危险的实验。

6
00:00:37,610 --> 00:00:39,960
Second, learning has become more efficient.
第二，学习变得更加高效了。

7
00:00:40,760 --> 00:00:50,710
Smart study apps can analyze students’ performance and recommend exercises that target their weak points, so students no longer waste time on what they have already mastered.
智能学习软件能够分析学生的学习表现，并推荐针对其薄弱环节的练习，这样学生就不再把时间浪费在已经掌握的内容上。

8
00:00:51,510 --> 00:00:58,830
In addition, recorded lectures and online discussion platforms allow students to make full use of their spare time.
此外，录播课和在线讨论平台让学生能够充分利用自己的空闲时间。

9
00:00:59,630 --> 00:01:09,090
Last semester, for instance, I prepared for a statistics exam with an online course, replaying the difficult parts until I fully understood them.
比如，上学期我借助一门网课备考统计学，把难懂的部分反复回放，直到完全弄懂为止。

10
00:01:09,890 --> 00:01:12,010
However, technology is only a tool.
然而，技术只是一种工具。

11
00:01:12,810 --> 00:01:18,310
Without self-discipline, students can easily be distracted by games and social media.
没有自律，学生很容易被游戏和社交媒体分散注意力。

12
00:01:19,110 --> 00:01:25,570
Therefore, they should use these resources purposefully and combine online learning with face-to-face communication.
因此，他们应当有目的地使用这些资源，并把线上学习与面对面交流结合起来。

13
00:01:26,370 --> 00:01:30,890
Properly used, information technology can transform the way we learn.
只要使用得当，信息技术就能改变我们的学习方式。
